{
  "info": {
    "name": "Proposta de Seguros API",
    "description": "Collection completa para testar o Sistema de Proposta de Seguros\n\n## Fluxo completo\n1. Criar proposta\n2. Listar propostas\n3. Obter proposta por ID\n4. Alterar status para Aprovada\n5. Contratar proposta\n6. Obter contratação\n\n## Variáveis de ambiente\n- `base_url_proposta`: URL do PropostaService\n- `base_url_contratacao`: URL do ContratacaoService\n- `proposta_id`: preenchido automaticamente após criar proposta\n- `contratacao_id`: preenchido automaticamente após contratar",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url_proposta",
      "value": "http://localhost:5001",
      "description": "URL base do PropostaService"
    },
    {
      "key": "base_url_contratacao",
      "value": "http://localhost:5002",
      "description": "URL base do ContratacaoService"
    },
    {
      "key": "proposta_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID da proposta criada — preenchido automaticamente"
    },
    {
      "key": "contratacao_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID da contratação — preenchido automaticamente"
    },
    {
      "key": "cpf",
      "value": "529.982.247-25",
      "description": "CPF de teste válido"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — PropostaService",
      "description": "Endpoints do PropostaService (:5001)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01.1 Criar Proposta — Seguro FGTS Protegido",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna proposta criada', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('EmAnalise');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('proposta_id', body.id);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('cpf', body.cpf);",
                  "    console.log('proposta_id salvo:', body.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeCliente\": \"João Silva Santos\",\n  \"cpf\": \"529.982.247-25\",\n  \"tipoSeguro\": 1,\n  \"valor\": 150.00\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas"]
            },
            "description": "Cria uma proposta de Seguro FGTS Protegido (tipo 1)\n\nTipos disponíveis:\n- 1 = SeguroFGTSProtegido (mín R$ 50)\n- 2 = SeguroVidaFamiliar (mín R$ 30)\n- 3 = SeguroCartaoProtegido (mín R$ 15)\n- 4 = ProtecaoCreditoTrabalhador (mín R$ 25)\n- 5 = SeguroContaCelularProtegidos (mín R$ 10)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.2 Criar Proposta — Seguro Vida Familiar",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status inicial EmAnalise', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('EmAnalise');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeCliente\": \"Maria Oliveira\",\n  \"cpf\": \"634.123.987-09\",\n  \"tipoSeguro\": 2,\n  \"valor\": 80.00\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.3 Criar Proposta — Valor abaixo do mínimo (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 422 Unprocessable', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna mensagem de erro', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeCliente\": \"Pedro Costa\",\n  \"cpf\": \"111.222.333-96\",\n  \"tipoSeguro\": 1,\n  \"valor\": 10.00\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas"]
            },
            "description": "Testa validação de valor mínimo — deve retornar 422"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.4 Listar Propostas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna array', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.5 Obter Proposta por ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna proposta correta', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('proposta_id'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas/{{proposta_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas", "{{proposta_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.6 Obter Proposta — ID inexistente (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404 Not Found', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.7 Alterar Status — Aprovada",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status alterado para Aprovada', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('Aprovada');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"novoStatus\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas/{{proposta_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas", "{{proposta_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Status:\n- 1 = EmAnalise\n- 2 = Aprovada\n- 3 = Rejeitada"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01.8 Alterar Status — Já Aprovada (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 422 Unprocessable', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna erro de status final', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"novoStatus\": 3\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas/{{proposta_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas", "{{proposta_id}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Testa regra de status final — proposta Aprovada não pode ser alterada"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — ContratacaoService",
      "description": "Endpoints do ContratacaoService (:5002)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "02.1 Contratar Proposta — Sucesso",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna contratacao criada', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.propostaId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('proposta_id'));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('contratacao_id', body.id);",
                  "    console.log('contratacao_id salvo:', body.id);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"propostaId\": \"{{proposta_id}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"{{cpf}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes"]
            },
            "description": "Contrata uma proposta aprovada.\n\n⚠️ Execute 01.7 antes para aprovar a proposta."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02.2 Contratar Proposta — Já contratada (409)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 409 Conflict', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(409);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna erro de idempotencia', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"propostaId\": \"{{proposta_id}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"{{cpf}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes"]
            },
            "description": "Testa idempotência — mesma proposta não pode ser contratada duas vezes"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02.3 Contratar Proposta — Não aprovada (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 422 Unprocessable', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"propostaId\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001\",\n  \"cpf\": \"529.982.247-25\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes"]
            },
            "description": "Testa contratação de proposta não aprovada — deve retornar 422"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02.4 Obter Contratacao por ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200 OK', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retorna contratacao correta', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('contratacao_id'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes/{{contratacao_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes", "{{contratacao_id}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02.5 Obter Contratacao — ID inexistente (404)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404 Not Found', () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Fluxo Completo",
      "description": "Execute em ordem para testar o fluxo completo end-to-end",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "03.1 Criar Proposta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('proposta_id', body.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('cpf', body.cpf);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nomeCliente\": \"Ana Paula Ferreira\",\n  \"cpf\": \"529.982.247-25\",\n  \"tipoSeguro\": 2,\n  \"valor\": 120.00\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.2 Aprovar Proposta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Status Aprovada', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('Aprovada');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"novoStatus\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_proposta}}/api/propostas/{{proposta_id}}/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url_proposta}}"],
              "path": ["api", "propostas", "{{proposta_id}}", "status"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.3 Contratar Proposta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('contratacao_id', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"propostaId\": \"{{proposta_id}}\",\n  \"cpf\": \"{{cpf}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03.4 Verificar Contratacao",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Contratacao completa', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.propostaId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('proposta_id'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url_contratacao}}/api/contratacoes/{{contratacao_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url_contratacao}}"],
              "path": ["api", "contratacoes", "{{contratacao_id}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
